<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Our every word will be exact</l><l>You can depend on it.</l><l>E-X-A-C-T, E-X-A-C-T, E-X-A-C-T.</l><l>Each word is accurate.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Our every deed will be exact.</l><l>You can depend on it.</l><l>E-X-A-C-T, E-X-A-C-T, E-X-A-C-T.</l><l>Each deed—we’ll do our best.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
